 "_comment": [
  "GENERATED snapshot of what the `authenticated` role may do on every live public relation.",
  "",
  "WHY. A correct RLS policy on a table with no matching GRANT never runs: the privilege is",
  "checked first, every call fails 42501, and the page shows an empty or error state (CLAUDE.md",
  "8.1 class 6). Column-level grants make it subtler: profiles allows UPDATE on 14 columns only,",
  "so a write naming one more column fails whole. On 2026-10-12 this killed the sign-up",
  "birth-date gate for every new member (FIXES_LOG.md) while every existing gate passed.",
  "scripts/grant-contract.py checks every client .from('t').<op>() against this file.",
  "",
  "SHAPE. relations.<name>.table is 'SIUD' (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE), '-' where absent.",
  "relations.<name>.columns.<PRIV> lists the granted columns, present only where the",
  "table-level privilege is absent and a column-level grant exists.",
  "",
  "REGENERATE whenever grants change live (same change, like live-schema.json): run the query",
  "in scripts/grant-contract.py's --help against project ydqhzvvoyufiiqvzcjns and replace",
  "`relations`. A stale snapshot gives false findings in both directions.",
  "",
  "functions: every public function the `authenticated` role can CALL END TO END (123, captured",
  "2026-10-12). EXECUTE on the public function is not enough: a SECURITY INVOKER wrapper runs",
  "`select private.<fn>(...)` as the caller, so it also needs EXECUTE on every private function it",
  "calls. 35 wrappers held the first grant and lacked the second -- approvals, delete-account, KYC,",
  "creation studio and knowledge search all failed 42501 until 20261012064126 (12 restored; the",
  "23 still blocked are called by no client and are listed in GAP_ANALYSIS.md S). A client",
  ".rpc('name') whose name is not here fails for every member. Regenerate with the query in",
  "scripts/grant-contract.py --help (FUNCTIONS)."
 ],
